{
  "about": "R0507 shared script (synthetic): request events as the app's sink and a mirror report them, answers, mode changes, run ends and task removals, with the approval.* / question.* events and the hooks.pending snapshots they must produce. Both the native book (runtime_pending_requests::tests) and the webview twin (runtime-pending-requests.ts, tests/extensions-runtime-pending-requests.spec.ts) replay every scenario and must agree with `expect` exactly. `call` and `input` stand for what runtime_hook_payload recorded for the call; `askAtHost` for a run launched ask-at-host (R0505); `mode` changes the task's current mode; `askedBy` is R0505's attribution of a package's ask, `attribute` R0508's of a package's answer. Snapshots leave `revision` out (it only grows). No harness was run.",
  "label": "synthetic",
  "at": "2026-11-17T09:00:00.000Z",
  "tasks": {
    "t1": { "project": "A", "harness": "claude", "mode": "ask", "run": "task" },
    "t2": { "project": "B", "harness": "codex", "mode": "ask", "run": "task" },
    "m1": { "project": "A", "harness": "opencode", "mode": "full", "run": "remote" }
  },
  "scenarios": [
